00:52:51.780 --> 00:52:53.780
came from

00:52:53.780 --> 00:52:55.780
the Greek islands. The islands where they spoke

00:52:55.780 --> 00:52:57.780
Greek.

00:52:57.780 --> 00:52:59.780
Probably, we don't know for sure,

00:52:59.780 --> 00:53:01.780
the parents were Ashkenaz.

00:53:01.780 --> 00:53:03.780
But it's not sure. This is

00:53:03.780 --> 00:53:05.780
speculation among scholars.

00:53:05.780 --> 00:53:07.780
But it certainly was not Sephardim.

00:53:07.780 --> 00:53:09.780
He didn't come from the Spanish speaking

00:53:09.780 --> 00:53:11.780
communities. He came from a community

00:53:11.780 --> 00:53:13.780
from an island that were like

00:53:13.780 --> 00:53:15.780
Ashkenaz and so on, that were Greek

00:53:15.780 --> 00:53:17.780
speaking communities.

00:53:17.780 --> 00:53:19.780
But, so it seems that they were not

00:53:19.780 --> 00:53:21.780
originally from that, but they had come

00:53:21.780 --> 00:53:23.780
from Ashkenaz and so on. Now.

00:53:23.780 --> 00:53:25.780
His father,

00:53:25.780 --> 00:53:27.780
he dealt with Paltry.

00:53:27.780 --> 00:53:29.780
But because

00:53:29.780 --> 00:53:31.780
Izmir, it's on the

00:53:31.780 --> 00:53:33.780
Izmir is a beautiful town, you should go.

00:53:33.780 --> 00:53:35.780
It's very nice. I mean, I was

00:53:35.780 --> 00:53:37.780
in Izmir many times. It's a beautiful

00:53:37.780 --> 00:53:39.780
old Jewish community.

00:53:39.780 --> 00:53:41.780
And Izmir is by the

00:53:41.780 --> 00:53:43.780
harbor. And therefore,

00:53:43.780 --> 00:53:45.780
there were many agents.

00:53:45.780 --> 00:53:47.780
Dutch agents,

00:53:47.780 --> 00:53:49.780
British agents,

00:53:49.780 --> 00:53:51.780
and French agents

00:53:51.780 --> 00:53:53.780
who they had merchandise, and they

00:53:53.780 --> 00:53:55.780
wanted some Jews, they needed always Jews,

00:53:55.780 --> 00:53:57.780
because only you could trust the Jews,

00:53:57.780 --> 00:53:59.780
to serve as a representative

00:53:59.780 --> 00:54:01.780
in Izmir. Either to

00:54:01.780 --> 00:54:03.780
receive the merchandise that they sent

00:54:03.780 --> 00:54:05.780
from Europe, or to send the payment

00:54:05.780 --> 00:54:07.780
and so on. The father of Shabbet

00:54:07.780 --> 00:54:09.780
Taizeri became

00:54:09.780 --> 00:54:11.780
an agent for Dutch

00:54:11.780 --> 00:54:13.780
and English merchants.

00:54:13.780 --> 00:54:15.780
And in a short time,

00:54:15.780 --> 00:54:17.780
he becomes a wealthy man.

00:54:17.780 --> 00:54:19.780
As a matter of fact, the two

00:54:19.780 --> 00:54:21.780
brothers of Shabbet Taizeri

00:54:21.780 --> 00:54:23.780
were very, very wealthy.

00:54:23.780 --> 00:54:25.780
They were businessmen.

00:54:25.780 --> 00:54:27.780
Shabbet Taizeri, apparently,

00:54:27.780 --> 00:54:29.780
everybody says two things

00:54:29.780 --> 00:54:31.780
about Shabbet Taizeri, even his great enemies.

00:54:31.780 --> 00:54:33.780
They say, he was a

00:54:33.780 --> 00:54:35.780
genius, a very intelligent person.

00:54:35.780 --> 00:54:37.780
And he studied with two

00:54:37.780 --> 00:54:39.780
great Hakhamim. One of them

00:54:39.780 --> 00:54:41.780
was Isaac the Alba, and the

00:54:41.780 --> 00:54:43.780
other, Yosef Eskava.

00:54:43.780 --> 00:54:45.780
The name Eskava is familiar to us.

00:54:45.780 --> 00:54:47.780
Yosef Eskava was the Ribbi Rashid,

00:54:47.780 --> 00:54:49.780
the chief Ribbi of Izmir.

00:54:49.780 --> 00:54:51.780
The second thing that they say about

00:54:51.780 --> 00:54:53.780
Shabbet Taizeri,

00:54:53.780 --> 00:54:55.780
everybody says, that not

00:54:55.780 --> 00:54:57.780
only he was a great

00:54:57.780 --> 00:54:59.780
genius, but he had the most

00:54:59.780 --> 00:55:01.780
charming, enchanting personality.

00:55:01.780 --> 00:55:03.780
Apparently, he was

00:55:03.780 --> 00:55:05.780
given charisma.

00:55:05.780 --> 00:55:07.780
He had, also to say,

00:55:07.780 --> 00:55:09.780
the sweetest of all boys. He must have been

00:55:09.780 --> 00:55:11.780
a great Hazzan. And

00:55:11.780 --> 00:55:13.780
he got the Semicha

00:55:13.780 --> 00:55:15.780
at the age of 15.

00:55:15.780 --> 00:55:17.780
So it shows that the man, apparently,

00:55:17.780 --> 00:55:19.780
when he was a young person,

00:55:19.780 --> 00:55:21.780
he was a very studious

00:55:21.780 --> 00:55:23.780
and very serious

00:55:23.780 --> 00:55:25.780
individual. But as soon as

00:55:25.780 --> 00:55:27.780
he got the Semicha,

00:55:27.780 --> 00:55:29.780
he retires from public

00:55:29.780 --> 00:55:31.780
life. And he

00:55:31.780 --> 00:55:33.780
started studying qabbala

00:55:33.780 --> 00:55:35.780
on his own.

00:55:35.780 --> 00:55:37.780
Now, I am prejudiced.

00:55:37.780 --> 00:55:39.780
I'm going to tell you I'm prejudiced.

00:55:39.780 --> 00:55:41.780
Parenthesis.

00:55:41.780 --> 00:55:43.780
Of course, my prejudice

00:55:43.780 --> 00:55:45.780
is also the effect of Shabbat Taizeri.

00:55:45.780 --> 00:55:47.780
Because in our tradition,

00:55:47.780 --> 00:55:49.780
they tell us two things about qabbala.

00:55:49.780 --> 00:55:51.780
I know today people don't listen to me,

00:55:51.780 --> 00:55:53.780
but there are two very important things about qabbala.

00:55:53.780 --> 00:55:55.780
Number one, they tell you

00:55:55.780 --> 00:55:57.780
never study qabbala on your own.

00:55:57.780 --> 00:55:59.780
That's number one.

00:55:59.780 --> 00:56:01.780
No matter who you are,

00:56:01.780 --> 00:56:03.780
what you are, don't study qabbala

00:56:03.780 --> 00:56:05.780
on your own. That's number one.

00:56:05.780 --> 00:56:07.780
And number two,

00:56:07.780 --> 00:56:09.780
do not begin, no matter how intelligent you are,

00:56:09.780 --> 00:56:11.780
do not begin studying qabbala

00:56:11.780 --> 00:56:13.780
until you're 40.

00:56:13.780 --> 00:56:15.780
My

00:56:15.780 --> 00:56:17.780
personal

00:56:17.780 --> 00:56:19.780
opinion is that

00:56:19.780 --> 00:56:21.780
these two mistakes

00:56:21.780 --> 00:56:23.780
cost the life,

00:56:23.780 --> 00:56:25.780
the spiritual life of hundreds of thousands of people.

00:56:25.780 --> 00:56:27.780
You're going to see how.

00:56:27.780 --> 00:56:29.780
He starts studying qabbala.

00:56:29.780 --> 00:56:31.780
And apparently he was so

00:56:31.780 --> 00:56:33.780
successful in...

00:56:33.780 --> 00:56:35.780
But he was always a recluse.

00:56:35.780 --> 00:56:37.780
That he got some students around him.

00:56:39.780 --> 00:56:41.780
And now,

00:56:41.780 --> 00:56:43.780
something they begin saying

00:56:43.780 --> 00:56:45.780
about him

00:56:45.780 --> 00:56:47.780
the following.

00:56:47.780 --> 00:56:49.780
That he was doing

00:56:49.780 --> 00:56:51.780
Ma'asim Zareem.

00:56:51.780 --> 00:56:53.780
What does it mean?

00:56:53.780 --> 00:56:55.780
Ma'asim Zareem?

00:56:55.780 --> 00:56:57.780
Ma'asim Zareem literally means

00:56:57.780 --> 00:56:59.780
strange

00:56:59.780 --> 00:57:01.780
behavior.

00:57:01.780 --> 00:57:03.780
What they meant in Izmir

00:57:03.780 --> 00:57:05.780
when they said that he

00:57:05.780 --> 00:57:07.780
was doing

00:57:07.780 --> 00:57:09.780
Ma'asim Zareem

00:57:09.780 --> 00:57:11.780
was things against

00:57:11.780 --> 00:57:13.780
the Jewish law.

00:57:15.780 --> 00:57:17.780
What would he do against things against the Jewish law?

00:57:19.780 --> 00:57:21.780
They say,

00:57:21.780 --> 00:57:23.780
they don't say much. Because you see,

00:57:23.780 --> 00:57:25.780
Jews are very circumspect.

00:57:25.780 --> 00:57:27.780
One of the things we don't like

00:57:27.780 --> 00:57:29.780
is Fatah.

00:57:31.780 --> 00:57:33.780
But two things they say about

00:57:33.780 --> 00:57:35.780
the Ma'asim Zareem.

00:57:35.780 --> 00:57:37.780
Number one, he used to pronounce

00:57:37.780 --> 00:57:39.780
the name of God.

00:57:39.780 --> 00:57:41.780
Yod Kebap Keh.

00:57:43.780 --> 00:57:45.780
To put it mildly,

00:57:45.780 --> 00:57:47.780
this is a no-no.

00:57:47.780 --> 00:57:49.780
The last person

00:57:49.780 --> 00:57:51.780
according to Jewish tradition

00:57:51.780 --> 00:57:53.780
who had the right to pronounce

00:57:53.780 --> 00:57:55.780
the name Yod Kebap Keh

00:57:55.780 --> 00:57:57.780
was Kohen Gadol

00:57:57.780 --> 00:57:59.780
Beyomah Kipurim.

00:57:59.780 --> 00:58:01.780
Kohen Gadol

00:58:01.780 --> 00:58:03.780
when he enters into

00:58:03.780 --> 00:58:05.780
this

00:58:05.780 --> 00:58:07.780
and then he had the right

00:58:07.780 --> 00:58:09.780
to say Yod Kebap Keh.

00:58:09.780 --> 00:58:11.780
Nobody else

00:58:11.780 --> 00:58:13.780
has

00:58:13.780 --> 00:58:15.780
the right

00:58:15.780 --> 00:58:17.780
by the way.

00:58:17.780 --> 00:58:19.780
By the way.

00:58:19.780 --> 00:58:21.780
Here it comes. By the way.

00:58:21.780 --> 00:58:23.780
The

00:58:23.780 --> 00:58:25.780
pronunciation of Yod Kebap Keh

00:58:25.780 --> 00:58:27.780
whatever it is, it is not

00:58:27.780 --> 00:58:29.780
according to the vocalization

00:58:29.780 --> 00:58:31.780
that you have in the Humash.

00:58:31.780 --> 00:58:33.780
So the

00:58:33.780 --> 00:58:35.780
stupid witness

00:58:35.780 --> 00:58:37.780
you know what it is? They're just stupid.

00:58:37.780 --> 00:58:39.780
That's not the way they pronounce the name.

00:58:39.780 --> 00:58:41.780
You know one of those witnesses and so on?

00:58:41.780 --> 00:58:43.780
These are

00:58:43.780 --> 00:58:45.780
the witnesses to Ahmad Rasul.

00:58:45.780 --> 00:58:47.780
Because there

00:58:47.780 --> 00:58:49.780
if you pay attention to the Mikud

00:58:49.780 --> 00:58:51.780
has the Mikud of Elokim.

00:58:51.780 --> 00:58:53.780
You know.

00:58:53.780 --> 00:58:55.780
I'm sorry. Of Ammonite.

00:58:55.780 --> 00:58:57.780
Of Ammonite. Only that

00:58:57.780 --> 00:58:59.780
they use the

00:58:59.780 --> 00:59:01.780
instead of Hatav

00:59:01.780 --> 00:59:03.780
they use Segol. That's all.

00:59:03.780 --> 00:59:05.780
So we do

00:59:05.780 --> 00:59:07.780
not know

00:59:07.780 --> 00:59:09.780
we do not

00:59:09.780 --> 00:59:11.780
know

00:59:11.780 --> 00:59:13.780
oh I'm sorry. We know

00:59:13.780 --> 00:59:15.780
one thing about the pronunciation of the name of Borei Olam.

00:59:15.780 --> 00:59:17.780
It's not the way it's printed in the

00:59:17.780 --> 00:59:19.780
Humash.

00:59:19.780 --> 00:59:21.780
And if you look sometimes

00:59:21.780 --> 00:59:23.780
it's a dream like the Rashash

00:59:23.780 --> 00:59:25.780
and so on.

00:59:25.780 --> 00:59:27.780
You see a whole series of Mikudim and so on.

00:59:27.780 --> 00:59:29.780
And to be

00:59:29.780 --> 00:59:31.780
things that is not for the average

00:59:31.780 --> 00:59:33.780
even intelligent person.

00:59:33.780 --> 00:59:35.780
Rambam

00:59:35.780 --> 00:59:37.780
and so on. They were totally against

00:59:37.780 --> 00:59:39.780
and that's the Jewish

00:59:39.780 --> 00:59:41.780
choice. Haram is Assur.

00:59:41.780 --> 00:59:43.780
One of the persons

00:59:43.780 --> 00:59:45.780
is

00:59:45.780 --> 00:59:47.780
you're not permitted to.

00:59:47.780 --> 00:59:49.780
A second thing

00:59:49.780 --> 00:59:51.780
that he used to do

00:59:51.780 --> 00:59:53.780
he used to do

00:59:53.780 --> 00:59:55.780
transgress the law.

00:59:55.780 --> 00:59:57.780
How he used to transgress the law?

00:59:57.780 --> 00:59:59.780
He used to eat forbidden

00:59:59.780 --> 01:00:01.780
fats. Halim.

01:00:01.780 --> 01:00:03.780
And he used to make a

01:00:03.780 --> 01:00:05.780
not a Barakha, a

01:00:05.780 --> 01:00:07.780
blasphemy.

01:00:07.780 --> 01:00:09.780
Barukhat Tama, Matvir Hal Asurim.

01:00:11.780 --> 01:00:13.780
Now

01:00:13.780 --> 01:00:15.780
what to do with this guy?

01:00:15.780 --> 01:00:17.780
On the one hand

01:00:17.780 --> 01:00:19.780
he was very amiable, he was very nice

01:00:19.780 --> 01:00:21.780
he was very learned

01:00:21.780 --> 01:00:23.780
he was very

01:00:23.780 --> 01:00:25.780
charitable

01:00:25.780 --> 01:00:27.780
on the other hand

01:00:27.780 --> 01:00:29.780
he had fits.

01:00:29.780 --> 01:00:31.780
According to Professor Gershon

01:00:31.780 --> 01:00:33.780
Sholem this person was a maniac

01:00:33.780 --> 01:00:35.780
depressive. People who study the personality

01:00:35.780 --> 01:00:37.780
they say he was a maniac depressive

01:00:37.780 --> 01:00:39.780
individual.

01:00:39.780 --> 01:00:41.780
Of course in those days they didn't know how to diagnose

01:00:41.780 --> 01:00:43.780
a maniac depressive.

01:00:43.780 --> 01:00:45.780
But the fact is

01:00:45.780 --> 01:00:47.780
that he would

01:00:49.780 --> 01:00:51.780
encourage this

01:00:51.780 --> 01:00:53.780
Ma'asim Zareem

01:00:53.780 --> 01:00:55.780
and in Izmir at that period

01:00:55.780 --> 01:00:57.780
the Ma'asim Zareem

01:00:57.780 --> 01:00:59.780
were confined only to forbidden

01:00:59.780 --> 01:01:01.780
foods.

01:01:01.780 --> 01:01:03.780
Alright?

01:01:03.780 --> 01:01:05.780
Plus

01:01:05.780 --> 01:01:07.780
the procession of the name of God.

01:01:07.780 --> 01:01:09.780
Two things

01:01:09.780 --> 01:01:11.780
happened.

01:01:11.780 --> 01:01:13.780
He

01:01:15.780 --> 01:01:17.780
married

01:01:17.780 --> 01:01:19.780
a young lady

01:01:19.780 --> 01:01:21.780
and after a short time he divorced her because he could not

01:01:21.780 --> 01:01:23.780
consume

01:01:23.780 --> 01:01:25.780
the marriage was not consummated.

01:01:25.780 --> 01:01:27.780
It happened twice.

01:01:27.780 --> 01:01:29.780
Apparently during that time

01:01:31.780 --> 01:01:33.780
he takes up the Sefer Tora

01:01:35.780 --> 01:01:37.780
and makes a chuppah

01:01:37.780 --> 01:01:39.780
Now for the

01:01:39.780 --> 01:01:41.780
Hakhamim in Izmir

01:01:41.780 --> 01:01:43.780
they loved him etc.

01:01:43.780 --> 01:01:45.780
That was too much for them.

01:01:45.780 --> 01:01:47.780
And then they decide

01:01:47.780 --> 01:01:49.780
to expel him

01:01:49.780 --> 01:01:51.780
from Izmir.

01:01:51.780 --> 01:01:53.780
Alright?

01:01:53.780 --> 01:01:55.780
Fine?

01:01:55.780 --> 01:01:57.780
Interesting individual.

01:01:57.780 --> 01:01:59.780
But this individual

01:01:59.780 --> 01:02:01.780
affect your life and my life.

01:02:01.780 --> 01:02:03.780
You want to see how?

01:02:03.780 --> 01:02:05.780
Our life today

01:02:05.780 --> 01:02:07.780
is directly affected

01:02:07.780 --> 01:02:09.780
because of that individual.

01:02:09.780 --> 01:02:11.780
You want to see how?

01:02:11.780 --> 01:02:13.780
Now

01:02:13.780 --> 01:02:15.780
He goes

01:02:15.780 --> 01:02:17.780
and he goes to Saloniki

01:02:17.780 --> 01:02:19.780
and he goes to Saloniki

01:02:19.780 --> 01:02:21.780
goes again there for a short time

01:02:21.780 --> 01:02:23.780
and then after going to

01:02:23.780 --> 01:02:25.780
Saloniki he goes to

01:02:25.780 --> 01:02:27.780
Castoria

01:02:27.780 --> 01:02:29.780
Castoria

01:02:29.780 --> 01:02:31.780
around what is today Yugoslavia

01:02:31.780 --> 01:02:33.780
the Balkans and so on.

01:02:33.780 --> 01:02:35.780
He spends there 4 or 5 years.

01:02:35.780 --> 01:02:37.780
Again

01:02:37.780 --> 01:02:39.780
we know that he is expelled

01:02:39.780 --> 01:02:41.780
from city to city

01:02:41.780 --> 01:02:43.780
he is expelled.

01:02:43.780 --> 01:02:45.780
Finally

01:02:45.780 --> 01:02:47.780
he comes to Egypt.

01:02:47.780 --> 01:02:49.780
In Egypt

01:02:49.780 --> 01:02:51.780
he meets

01:02:51.780 --> 01:02:53.780
a person, the president of the community.

01:02:53.780 --> 01:02:55.780
His name was

01:02:55.780 --> 01:02:57.780
Yosef Rafael

01:02:57.780 --> 01:02:59.780
Celebi

01:02:59.780 --> 01:03:01.780
obviously if you know Turkish

01:03:01.780 --> 01:03:03.780
he is a Turkish title, must have been a dignitary

01:03:03.780 --> 01:03:05.780
a Turkish dignitary

01:03:05.780 --> 01:03:07.780
and he was a president of the community.

01:03:07.780 --> 01:03:09.780
And he gets along very very very well

01:03:09.780 --> 01:03:11.780
with this person

01:03:11.780 --> 01:03:13.780
Yosef Celebi.

01:03:13.780 --> 01:03:15.780
He goes to Israel

01:03:15.780 --> 01:03:17.780
goes to Yerushalayim

01:03:17.780 --> 01:03:19.780
and again in Yerushalayim

01:03:19.780 --> 01:03:21.780
he starts with the

01:03:21.780 --> 01:03:23.780
Maasim Zarim

01:03:23.780 --> 01:03:25.780
Alright?

01:03:25.780 --> 01:03:27.780
Strange things

01:03:27.780 --> 01:03:29.780
they threaten him

01:03:29.780 --> 01:03:31.780
and

01:03:31.780 --> 01:03:33.780
apparently after they threaten him

01:03:33.780 --> 01:03:35.780
with excommunication

01:03:35.780 --> 01:03:37.780
he calms down

01:03:37.780 --> 01:03:39.780
and he seems to be like one of the boys

01:03:39.780 --> 01:03:41.780
he is charming

01:03:41.780 --> 01:03:43.780
he is wealthy

01:03:43.780 --> 01:03:45.780
he is very well learned

01:03:45.780 --> 01:03:47.780
and

01:03:47.780 --> 01:03:49.780
he is very

01:03:49.780 --> 01:03:51.780
apparently very sociable

01:03:51.780 --> 01:03:53.780
big mistake

01:03:53.780 --> 01:03:55.780
they send them

01:03:55.780 --> 01:03:57.780
in the name of the Hakhamim of Yerushalayim

01:03:57.780 --> 01:03:59.780
to collect

01:03:59.780 --> 01:04:01.780
money from Egypt

01:04:01.780 --> 01:04:03.780
when he goes to Egypt

01:04:03.780 --> 01:04:05.780
representing

01:04:05.780 --> 01:04:07.780
the Hakhamim of Yerushalayim

01:04:07.780 --> 01:04:09.780
as a Shaliyah

